hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"230","Qāla ṣallā Allāhu ʿalayhi wa-sallam: \Allāhumma fa-ayyumā mu'min sababtuhu fa-jʿal dhālika lahu qurbatun ilayka yawm al-qiyāmah.\"". He (peace be upon him) said: \""O Allah"","" if I have cursed any believer"","" make that a means of closeness to You on the Day of Judgment.\"""""""
"231","Qāla ṣallā Allāhu ʿalayhi wa-sallam: \Idhā kāna aḥadukum mādiḥan ṣāḥibahu lā maḥālata fal-yaqul: Aḥsibu fulānan wa-llāhu ḥasībuhu"","" wa-lā uzakkī ʿalā Allāhi aḥadan"","" aḥsibuhu – in kāna yaʿlamu dhāka – kadhā wa-kadhā.\"". The Prophet (peace be upon him) said: \""When one of you praises his companion"","" he should say: 'I think so-and-so is such-and-such"","" and Allah is his Reckoner"","" and I do not purify anyone before Allah; I think him to be such-and-such' – if he knows that about him.\"""""""
